<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/xapi-persona> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A set of one or more identity representations that uniquely describes an Actor in a particular context. The standard distinguishes personas from the broader real-world person." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/xapi-persona/versions/1> .
