<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/xapi-persona> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "The persona model recognizes that the same person may be represented differently across contexts or systems, which affects how records can safely be correlated." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/xapi-persona/versions/1> .
